\details{
The columns after \code{trial} are the family's own. Every family returns
\code{p}, the fitted probability of the choice that was actually made, and
\code{pe}, the prediction error the outcome produced. The value stores
vary: \code{q1} and \code{q2} for a two-armed family, \code{mu1} to \code{mu4} and \code{s1}
